# Design System & Concepts

The Tuff design system is not a mere collection of visual tokens, but a rigorous engineering contract built upon **perceptual ergonomics**, **modern streaming computation**, and **high-velocity productivity discipline**.

This section systematically breaks down the "why" and "how" behind every design decision across geometry, material physics, color science, typography, micro-motion, and AI streaming interactions.

## Geometry and Curvature

- **[G2 Continuous Curvature & Squircle Geometry](./curvature.en.mdc)** — Moving beyond standard `border-radius` fillets, explaining curvature jumps, superellipse formulas, and Apple smooth corners.
- **[Concentric Radii & Inset Clearance](./concentricity.en.mdc)** — The $R_{\text{outer}} = R_{\text{inner}} + \text{Padding}$ conservation law, caret clipping prevention, and 0.65x vertical optical padding.
- **[Open-Order Z-Index & Sticky Dividers](./depth-topology.en.mdc)** — Eliminating `z-index: 99999` chaos: overlays take numbers from one counter in the order they open, drawers first lift it to 10000, and the 1px line divider rule.

## Surfaces and Material Physics

- **[Surface 8-Material Taxonomy & Gatekeepers](./surface-taxonomy.en.mdc)** — Refraction (default), Glass, Acrylic, Mica and the 8-surface matrix with explicit user confirmation gatekeepers.
- **[Refraction Pipeline & Chromatic Dispersion](./refraction-physics.en.mdc)** — Snell's Law, SVG displacement-map filters, Smoothstep intensity mapping, and RGB chromatic dispersion.
- **[Adaptive Surface Deduction & 120Hz Fallback](./surface-deduction.en.mdc)** — Pointer velocity sensing, window move hooks, frame budget probes and power saving, with a 0ms fallback and 140ms asymmetric recovery.
- **[Alpha Noise Masks & Specular Tracking](./noise-and-specular.en.mdc)** — Solving overlay greyness via `mask-composite: intersect` alpha noise and card specular cursor tracking.

## Color Science and Dark Mode

- **[#141414 Canvas & 3-Tier Elevation](./dark-palette.en.mdc)** — Why not pure `#000000`? Preventing OLED purple smearing, preserving shadows, and the 3-tier dark grey scale.
- **[Retinal Irradiation & Weight Tuning](./irradiation-tuning.en.mdc)** — Helmholtz optical irradiation illusion, perceived expansion of white text on dark, the dark theme's 460/560/660 weight tuning, and static font fallbacks.
- **[Bipolar Semantic Tints & WCAG 4.5:1](./color-mix-contrast.en.mdc)** — Resolving dark mode `-light-9` distortion, `color-mix` ink fusion, and WCAG 4.5:1 verified across all themes.
- **[Light Modes & Hue Sorting](./light-modes.en.mdc)** — Why `plus-lighter` turns grey on light backgrounds, and the dual independent hue ordering pipeline.

## Typography and Text Engineering

- **[13–14px Desktop Baseline & 0.9em Code](./type-scale.en.mdc)** — Differences between productivity tools and marketing pages, scanning fatigue, and monospace code 0.9em optical harmony.
- **[Modern Soft Wrapping & Zero Tracking](./smart-wrapping.en.mdc)** — `text-wrap: pretty` orphan prevention, `balance` heading symmetry, streaming stability, and zero tracking on body text.

